#: evergreen_content_poster.php:587
msgid "Would you like to delete all Evergreen Content Poster data?"
msgstr "¿Te gustaría borrar todos los datos de Evergreen Content Poster?"

#: evergreen_content_poster.php:590
msgid ""
"By default your social media posting schedule, Evergreen Content Poster "
"options, and evergreen content (your social media posts) are not deleted "
"when you deactivate the Evergreen Content Poster. If you are deleting the "
"Evergreen Content Poster completely from your website and want those items "
"removed as well check this option.<br /><strong>Note: This will permanently "
"delete all Evergreen Content Poster data from your database.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, tu calendario de publicación en medios sociales, las opciones "
"de Evergreen Content Poster y el contenido «evergreen» (tus entradas de "
"medios sociales) no se borran cuando desactivas Evergreen Content Poster. Si "
"vas a borrar Evergreen Content Poster de tu web completamente y quieres que "
"esos elementos se eliminen también, haz clic en esta opción. <br /"
"><strong>Nota: esto borrará permanentemente todos los datos de Evergreen "
"Content Poster de tu base de datos.</strong>"

